---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo evaluators test])

    Identifier{Fully qualified identifier?}
    Lookup[Lookup evaluator by identity]
    Found{Evaluator exists?}
    State{Evaluator can be tested?}
    InputSource{Input source valid?}
    ReadInput[Read input payload]
    ParseInput{Input JSON valid?}
    Execute[Execute evaluator WASM]
    Normalize[Normalize evaluator output]
    Payload[Build result payload]

    Success([Success response])

    IdentifierFail([Identifier format error])
    NotFoundFail([Evaluator not found error])
    LookupFail([Database lookup error])
    StateFail([Evaluator state error])
    InputSourceFail([Input source error])
    InputReadFail([Input read error])
    InputJsonFail([Input JSON error])
    ExecutionFail([Evaluator execution error])

    Start --> Identifier

    Identifier -- No --> IdentifierFail
    Identifier -- Yes --> Lookup

    Lookup --> Found
    Lookup -. Lookup fails .-> LookupFail

    Found -- No --> NotFoundFail
    Found -- Yes --> State

    State -- No --> StateFail
    State -- Yes --> InputSource

    InputSource -- No --> InputSourceFail
    InputSource -- Yes --> ReadInput

    ReadInput --> ParseInput
    ReadInput -. Read fails .-> InputReadFail

    ParseInput -- No --> InputJsonFail
    ParseInput -- Yes --> Execute

    Execute --> Normalize
    Execute -. Execution fails .-> ExecutionFail

    Normalize --> Payload
    Payload --> Success

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class Identifier,Lookup,Found,State,InputSource,ReadInput,ParseInput,Execute,Normalize,Payload system
    class IdentifierFail,NotFoundFail,LookupFail,StateFail,InputSourceFail,InputReadFail,InputJsonFail,ExecutionFail error
